{"air_date":"2025-12-20T00:00:00.0000000Z","episode_number":178,"name":"黄泉妖圣","overview":"妖暝在萧炎协助下斩杀叛弟妖啸天，重掌九幽地冥蟒族大权。为报答萧炎，妖暝开放族内至宝黄泉石碑。萧炎灵魂进入石碑，接受远古强者黄泉妖圣的考验。凭借天境灵魂力和异火之力，萧炎硬抗黄泉妖圣攻势，通过九层试炼，不仅掌握黄泉指、黄泉掌、黄泉天怒三大天阶斗技，还获得黄泉妖圣的本源精血，实力提升至一星斗圣后期。同时，彩鳞也获得进入九幽黄泉深处，寻找七彩吞天蟒远古巢穴与先祖传承的机会。","id":5821789,"production_code":"","season_number":5,"still_path":"/aKiZ4Nrxz0QRFp9JhBpZIigbcIA.jpg","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"images":{"stills":[{"aspect_ratio":1.778,"file_path":"/aKiZ4Nrxz0QRFp9JhBpZIigbcIA.jpg","height":2160,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"width":3840}]},"external_ids":{},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2793092,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"刘三木","original_name":"劉三木","popularity":0.5307,"profile_path":"/vM7zNuIun62XuL4AN6fWuq5q1CV.jpg","cast_id":0,"character":"Young Xiao Yan (voice)","credit_id":"634046dfddd52d0089710962","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2340094,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"刘雨轩","original_name":"刘雨轩","popularity":0.612,"cast_id":0,"character":"Yao Lao / Yao Chen (voice)","credit_id":"63404715b4a543007a04547e","order":2},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":126526,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"万苏婉","original_name":"万苏婉","popularity":0.4052,"cast_id":0,"character":"Medusa / Cai Lin (voice)","credit_id":"634047361a3248007e896435","order":3},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1965298,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"鬼月","original_name":"祝俊","popularity":0.4644,"profile_path":"/gFazUOvuMBvBhLMVX7AFvBEHDqS.jpg","cast_id":0,"character":"Nalan Yanran / Ya Fei (voice)","credit_id":"63404745e04d8a0081287aa5","order":4},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":3056264,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"陈奕雯","original_name":"陳奕雯","popularity":0.5679,"cast_id":0,"character":"Xiao Xuner / Gu Xuner (voice)","credit_id":"63404754c39266008378b8b3","order":5},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1528979,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"杨梦露","original_name":"杨梦露","popularity":0.6721,"cast_id":0,"character":"Yunzhi / Yu